//   3. add an entry to ADV_MAPS with its stages. A stage with  boss: true  is a boss fight (sc = size, hp = health).
// Enemy robots are picked from your normal robot list, so no new robot art is needed except for bosses.

// ---- solid ground of the Adventure maps (same format as MAP_RUNS in maps.js) ----
